# Protected Numerical Core

The validated numerical engine is protected.

Do not modify without explicit approval:

- governing shallow-water equations
- finite-volume discretization
- Rusanov flux
- hydrostatic reconstruction
- bed-slope source formulation
- Manning source mathematics
- CFL/timestep logic
- boundary-condition mathematics
- validated numerical constants

Do not introduce:

- artificial damping
- unexplained stability floors
- clipping
- epsilon hacks
- empirical masks
- arbitrary CFL reductions

If a requested change appears to require modifying the numerical core,
stop and explain the conflict before editing it.

Prefer implementing new functionality around the numerical engine through
the public API/application layer.
